<H1>Motorcycle Trip from Baker City, OR to Home August 13, 2020</H1>
<BR>
<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=13g4RUda9L-gNqWOMlCzdDJd7-ZoX6wT1" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_sturgis_20200813.jpg" ALIGN=RIGHT style="width:592px"></A>
A playlist of all of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL65CwO7O2fX9ywTw4se2CSAEcjz6EdwFh" target="_blank">the videos from</A> the ride from August 4 thru August 13th.
<BR><BR>
Left Baker City OR to go home. Did not take any pictures.
<BR><BR>
Cody took us on another of my favorite routes on Wa 821 through <a href="https://youtu.be/ChzXwMG1qZw" target="_blank">Yakima Canyon</A>. I love that route, LOTS of twisties.
<BR><BR>
Going home you have to go through one of the passes, we went home <a href="https://youtu.be/RwRfohTWiS8" target="_blank">over I-90, Snoqualmie Pass</A>. As always beautiful views of the mountains.
<BR><BR>
